      "start_s": 27.979,
      "seconds": 4.731,
      "caption": "The draft says revenue grew 18% from a year ago. That's the quarterly rate.",
      "spoken_text": "The draft says revenue grew eighteen percent from a year ago. That's the quarterly rate.",
